  | 2 => ⟨(204 : ℤ), (59881076569106441137684574300903436634847832753805281019799 : ℤ), (835387290722356328202469282393424863701496288091999276548395 : ℤ)⟩

theorem V_mem : V.mem (fTop c) := by
